      "features": [
        {
          "feature": "conditions_or_retries",
          "reason": "Context creation writes the local name-to-context map only when a context name was supplied.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "path": "scripts/browserbase_manager.py",
              "start_line": 234,
              "end_line": 238,
              "quote": "        # If a name was provided, save it locally\n        if args.name:\n            contexts = _load_contexts()\n            contexts[args.name] = context.id\n            _save_contexts(contexts)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "feature": "persistence_or_cross_session",
          "reason": "Named contexts and persist-enabled sessions retain authentication state for later browser sessions; persistence is explicitly selected with the CLI flag.",
          "evidence": [
            {
              "path": "SKILL.md",
              "start_line": 85,
              "end_line": 113,
              "quote": "### Context Management (for authentication persistence)\n\nCreate a named context to store login state:\n```bash\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/browserbase_manager.py create-context --name github\n```\n\nList all saved contexts:\n```bash\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/browserbase_manager.py list-contexts\n```\n\nDelete a context (by name or ID):\n```bash\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/browserbase_manager.py delete-context --context-id github\n```\n\n### Session Lifecycle\n\nCreate a new session (captcha solving and recording enabled by default):\n```bash\n# Basic session\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/browserbase_manager.py create-session\n\n# Session with saved context (persist=true saves cookies on close)\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/browserbase_manager.py create-session --context-id github --persist\n\n# Keep-alive session for long research (survives disconnections)\npython3 {baseDir}/scripts/browserbase_manager.py create-session --context-id github --persist --keep-alive --timeout 3600"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source_closure": {
        "status": "complete_for_static_audit",
        "reason": "The required browserbase_manager.py, requirements.txt, and referenced API quick reference are retained. Browserbase, Playwright, pip/uv, environment credentials, browser pages, and generated context configuration remain external or runtime interfaces.",
        "local_reference_decisions": []
      }
    },
